<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Great Pacific War- Break out, 2020</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;It has been several years since the Taiwan reunification with China.&amp;nbsp; War has broken out between the Sino-Russian (axis) alliance and Japan after an escalating crisis related to the ongoing&amp;nbsp;dispute over the Senkaku Islands.&amp;nbsp; The US and allies side with Japan but devastating Chinese and Russian strikes have crippled Japan and the major US bases in the Western Pacific.&amp;nbsp; The axis have air and maritime dominance in the East China Sea and are preparing to invade Okinawa.&amp;nbsp; An axis CSG group has passed through the Miyako Straight&amp;nbsp;into the Western Pacific to cut off Okinawa and Japan&amp;nbsp;from allied reinforcements.&amp;nbsp; An allied carrier strike group sailing toward the area is tasked with the&amp;nbsp;securing sea lanes leading to Japan. &lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
